<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 376 ALL OUT IN 1ST INNINGS V ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 376 ALL OUT IN 1ST INNINGS V ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were bowled out for 376</p>
<p>in their first innings on the second day of the first test</p>
<p>against England at Queen's Club on Thursday.</p>
</text>
